<div class="text-center py-5">
  <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_NAME", "VotePIP Demo") %></h1>
  <p class="lead text-muted mt-2"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_TAGLINE", "") %></p>
  <p class="text-muted mx-auto mt-3" style="max-width: 620px;">
    A proposal that bundles three things, or can&rsquo;t be answered yes or no, wastes a meeting. Write your
    draft the way it comes to you. The clarity check tells you whether it is one proposal or several, whether
    people can vote it up or down, what a reader would still ask, and two small edits, then hands you a clean
    motion. It never says whether the idea is good, and it never names a person.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
    <% if signed_in? %>
      <%= link_to "Go to my proposals", proposals_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
    <% else %>
      <%= link_to "Try it free", sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", sign_in_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="my-5 opacity-25">

<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 860px;">
  <h2 class="h5 text-muted text-center mb-4">Example &mdash; a fictional housing co-op&rsquo;s draft</h2>

  <div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
      <p class="text-muted small mb-1">The draft</p>
      <p class="mb-0 fst-italic">
        &ldquo;The lobby is a mess. We should repaint the lobby before winter, stop people leaving bikes in the
        ground-floor hallway, and move $3,000 from the reserve fund to pay for it.&rdquo;
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="mb-2">
        <span class="badge verdict-badge text-bg-warning">2 proposals bundled</span>
        <span class="badge verdict-badge text-bg-warning">Not yet votable</span>
      </div>
      <p class="lead mb-0">This is two proposals: repainting the lobby and a rule about bikes in the hallway. Each needs its own vote.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="h6 mb-2">1. Repaint the lobby</h3>
        <blockquote class="motion small mb-0">That the co-op repaints the lobby before winter, paying up to $3,000 from the reserve fund.</blockquote>
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="h6 mb-2">2. No bikes in the hallway</h3>
        <blockquote class="motion small mb-0">That bikes may not be left in the ground-floor hallway.</blockquote>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-4 small">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3 class="h6">A reader might still ask</h3>
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>Is the $3,000 for the paint alone, or for both changes?</li>
        <li>Where would bikes be stored instead?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3 class="h6">Suggested edits</h3>
      <ol class="mb-0">
        <li>Say which month &ldquo;before winter&rdquo; means.</li>
        <li>Name the most the repainting may cost.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-center text-muted small mt-4">
    AI-generated. A reader&rsquo;s first pass, not a ruling: it never judges whether the idea is good.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="text-center mt-5 pb-4">
  <% unless signed_in? %>
    <%= link_to "Check your own proposal &rarr;".html_safe, sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
  <% end %>
  <div class="mt-3 text-muted small">
    Open source &middot;
    <a href="https://votepip.com" class="text-muted">VotePIP</a>
  </div>
</div>
